{
  "about": [
    "Build 61's pieces that depend on each other (contract 2.2, 3.2, 10.1, 10.3; D42), written by hand. FPCore's PiecesTests and LinkStateTests read every row; the page's mock (tests/lib/harness.js MOCK_RULES) is held to the same rows (P13).",
    "Pieces in the binary's order: coach, coachHome, tabs. Every list below is in that order. One page build, P1.",
    "resolve: base = the pieces whose own checks pass; tabsRoot = the scene's root is a live tab root (one that has not fallen back). on = the pieces on; needs = each piece of base off only because of another, with what it needs ('root' for tabs under a root that is not a live tab root). A piece off for its own reason never reports needs.",
    "hello: base = the pieces whose own checks pass at the hello for P1 (device switch, policy, crash verdict, breaker, decline: ScreenGate.base), the OS step left to os (below 26 tabs is off 'os' and the root is classic). root = 'tabs' (a live tab root), 'classic' (built classic: iOS 17/18, the gate, or no launch values) or 'fellBack' (a tab root that fell back earlier in the scene: the classic rule, and never a second fallback). hello = the page's {v, screens}. want.v and want.why = the reply's version and refusal word; want.screens = the reply's screens; want.tabs = the reply carries tabs (tabs negotiated); want.declined = the pieces recorded as declined for P1; want.fellBack = the fallback this hello triggers (the scene falls back first, then this same hello is negotiated on the classic rule); want.needs = ScreenGate.evaluate's needs after the hello (its declines recorded, on the root after it).",
    "cascade: a linked document under root, set up by a hello naming all three with base = live. event: {trip: piece} three failures in a row of the piece's own intents or models; {tripShell: true} three failed shell intents (ping, shell.covered, confirm, toast.undo, screens.off), which count against every live piece; {withdraw: piece} the host turned it off for the document (the policy file, a device switch). want.off = the screens.off the page hears, in order ({screen, why, needs?}); want.trips = the pieces with a breaker record (a cascade is never a trip); want.fellBack = the fallback the link starts (a tabs trip under a live tab root).",
    "rootChange: setTabsRoot(false) from the host (a fallback it starts itself: dismiss {screen:'tabs'}, the policy file, the device switch), the document set up as in cascade by a hello with base (linked) or awaiting its hello (not linked). want.off = the screens.off for the pieces negotiated under the tab root's rule (coach included, whose stack is gone: by root change, not by the classic rule); tabs itself goes off in the document silently, the host telling the page with its own word, or not at all after dismiss tabs. want.sameDocument = what the same hello negotiates in this document afterwards (the awaited hello when not linked); want.nextDocument = what it negotiates in the scene's next document (the classic rule)."
  ],
  "pieces": ["coach", "coachHome", "tabs"],
  "resolve": [
    { "base": [], "tabsRoot": true, "on": [], "needs": {} },
    { "base": ["coach"], "tabsRoot": true, "on": [], "needs": { "coach": ["coachHome"] } },
    { "base": ["coachHome"], "tabsRoot": true, "on": [], "needs": { "coachHome": ["tabs", "coach"] } },
    { "base": ["tabs"], "tabsRoot": true, "on": ["tabs"], "needs": {} },
    { "base": ["coach", "coachHome"], "tabsRoot": true, "on": [], "needs": { "coach": ["coachHome"], "coachHome": ["tabs"] } },
    { "base": ["coach", "tabs"], "tabsRoot": true, "on": ["tabs"], "needs": { "coach": ["coachHome"] } },
    { "base": ["coachHome", "tabs"], "tabsRoot": true, "on": ["tabs"], "needs": { "coachHome": ["coach"] } },
    { "base": ["coach", "coachHome", "tabs"], "tabsRoot": true, "on": ["coach", "coachHome", "tabs"], "needs": {} },
    { "base": [], "tabsRoot": false, "on": [], "needs": {} },
    { "base": ["coach"], "tabsRoot": false, "on": ["coach"], "needs": {} },
    { "base": ["coachHome"], "tabsRoot": false, "on": [], "needs": { "coachHome": ["tabs", "coach"] } },
    { "base": ["tabs"], "tabsRoot": false, "on": [], "needs": { "tabs": ["root"] } },
    { "base": ["coach", "coachHome"], "tabsRoot": false, "on": ["coach"], "needs": { "coachHome": ["tabs"] } },
    { "base": ["coach", "tabs"], "tabsRoot": false, "on": ["coach"], "needs": { "tabs": ["root"] } },
    { "base": ["coachHome", "tabs"], "tabsRoot": false, "on": [], "needs": { "coachHome": ["tabs", "coach"], "tabs": ["root"] } },
    { "base": ["coach", "coachHome", "tabs"], "tabsRoot": false, "on": ["coach"], "needs": { "coachHome": ["tabs"], "tabs": ["root"] } }
  ],
  "hello": [
    {
      "case": "tab root: a tabs-mode page names all three",
      "base": ["coach", "coachHome", "tabs"], "os": 27, "root": "tabs", "hello": { "v": 1, "screens": ["coachHome", "coach", "tabs"] },
      "want": { "v": 1, "why": null, "screens": ["coach", "coachHome", "tabs"], "tabs": true, "declined": [], "fellBack": null, "needs": {} }
    },
    {
      "case": "tab root: coach and tabs named, coachHome left out: tabs alone, coachHome declined, coach needs it",
      "base": ["coach", "coachHome", "tabs"], "os": 27, "root": "tabs", "hello": { "v": 1, "screens": ["coach", "tabs"] },
      "want": { "v": 1, "why": null, "screens": ["tabs"], "tabs": true, "declined": ["coachHome"], "fellBack": null, "needs": { "coach": ["coachHome"] } }
    },
